%% Activity Diagram — Week 8
%% Shows the flow of one key user workflow.
%% Render at: https://mermaid.live

flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Input[User enters input]
    Input --> Validate{Input valid?}
    Validate -- No --> Error[Show error message]
    Error --> Input
    Validate -- Yes --> Call[Call LLM API]
    Call --> Wait[Wait for response]
    Wait --> Parse[Parse and format response]
    Parse --> Display[Display to user]
    Display --> Again{Another query?}
    Again -- Yes --> Input
    Again -- No --> End([End])
